#: ../Site/DemosPage.qml:65
msgid "Add items to the basket, then edit Shell.qml right in the page. Move a Slot to rearrange the interface while the basket keeps its items, or introduce a syntax error: the last shell that compiled keeps running, with the compiler message shown beside the editor. Switch light and dark themes to watch both shells follow."
